=============================================================================
TopTronic CAN bus - reference capture (candump + toptronic debug)
=============================================================================
Date      : 2026-08-17 (after the 0x56 extended-response fix)
Config    : device 47FF (HV), gateway 4208 (GW), 50 kbps
Evidence  : multi-frame reassembly (TOTAL frame count in first byte),
            CRC-16 validation, 0x56 extended responses, unknown traffic.

Key results
  - 'Cleaning count value message cleaning (operating weeks)'  -> 52
  - 'Maint.ctr.value message maint. (op. wks)'                 -> 52
  Both update after the extended-response (0x56) decoding was added.

Format
  Single-frame   GET : 01 40 <fg> <fn> <dp_hi> <dp_lo>
                 RES : 01 42 <fg> <fn> <dp_hi> <dp_lo> <value...>
  Multi-frame   first-frame byte 0 upper 5 bits = TOTAL frame count
                (first frame + continuations); reassembler waits for
                total - 1 continuation frames.
  0x56 response  = extended RESPONSE: value starts at offset 7
                   (2 extra bytes 0x80 0x00 between datapoint and value).
=============================================================================

