2) 0x56 extended RESPONSE - Cleaning count (3-frame, header 0x19 = 3 TOTAL)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[GET] Data: 0x01400000a28d                       <- sensor poll (fg=00 fn=00 dp=A28D)

[D][toptronic:618]: - Start of message with id: 95 with length 3
[I][candump:026]: 0x1F5047FF : 19 5F 56 00 00 A2 8D 80   <- byte0=0x19 -> 3 total
[I][candump:026]: 0x1E1047FF : 5F 00 00 00 00 00 00 00   <- continuation #1
[I][candump:026]: 0x1D9047FF : 5F 34 10 B3               <- continuation #2 (+CRC 0x10B3)
[D][toptronic:582]: [RES] Can-ID: 0x1D9047FF, Sensor: Cleaning count value message cleaning (operating weeks), Data: 0x560000a28d800000000000000034
[S][sensor]: 'Cleaning count value message cleaning (operating weeks)' >> 52

  Reassembled payload : 56 00 00 A2 8D 80 00 00 00 00 34 10 B3
  CRC-16 fields       : CRC hi=0x10, CRC lo=0xB3 (validated by compute_crc16)
  Value at offset 7   : 00 00 00 34  -> U32 0x34 = 52          (cleaning count, weeks)

