   Register 0x74 set - not configured in presets -> [UNK]
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[I][candump:026]: 0x1F5047FF : 11 44 74 00 FF 00 00 00
[I][candump:026]: 0x1E9047FF : 44 00 FF FF 71 E5
[D][toptronic:656]: - Part of message with id: 68 with remaining length 0
[D][toptronic:716]: [UNK] Can-ID: 0x1E9047FF, Data: 0x7400ff00000000ffff

  Note: byte0=0x11 -> 2 TOTAL -> 1 continuation (waits for exactly 1).
