8) Loop-latency cost of candump (full-traffic INFO logging)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[W][component:473]: canbus took a long time for an operation (192 ms), max is 50 ms

  Cause: candump logs every frame with a per-frame std::string build on the
  loop task. Remove/comment the canbus.yaml on_frame candump in production.

